<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon, Read starts three banks.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Dillon, Read starts three banks.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dillon, Read said it initiated coverage of PNC Bank Corp and CoreStates Financial Corp with an outperform rating.</p>
<p>-- put a neutral rating on Wachovia Corp.</p>
</text>
